# Per-Dockerfile build context for the static-analyzer image (ES-2, ADR 0016).
#
# BuildKit reads THIS file (named `<dockerfile>.dockerignore`) instead of the
# repo-root .dockerignore when building docker/static_analyzer/Dockerfile.
# Allowlist style: ignore the entire repo, then re-include only the trees the
# Dockerfile COPYs. The context drops from the whole repo (ui/, tests/, ... —
# hundreds of MB / thousands of files, slow over Docker Desktop's macOS<->VM
# file sharing) to a few hundred KB, so context transfer is no longer a factor.
#
# Requires BuildKit (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=1) — the Makefile static-build target sets it.
*
!packages
!static_runtime
!docker/static_analyzer
